{"document_id": "53d9bdda-6d14-42ca-8fdf-30f255381a24", "crop": "mango", "organization": "TNAU", "source": "TNAU", "source_url": "https://agritech.tnau.ac.in/crop_protection/mango_1.html", "title": "TNAU Agritech Portal :: Crop Protection", "retrieved_at": "2026-09-06T23:39:22.700334", "content": "| ![TNAU Agritech Portal](https://agritech.tnau.ac.in/crop_protection/images/index/cp_index.jpg)  |  \n| --- |  \n|  [Home](https://agritech.tnau.ac.in/index.html \"Home\") | [About Us](https://agritech.tnau.ac.in/about_us/abt_us.html \"About Us\") | [Success Stories](https://agritech.tnau.ac.in/success_stories/success_index.html \"Success Stories\") | [Farmers Association](https://agritech.tnau.ac.in/farm_association/farm_assoct.html \"Farmer's Association\") | [Farmers' Innovation](https://agritech.tnau.ac.in/farm_innovations/farm_innovations.html) | [Publications](https://agritech.tnau.ac.in/tnau_publish.html \"TNAU Publications\") | [Contact](https://agritech.tnau.ac.in/contact.html \"Contact Us\")  |   |  \n|    \nHorticultural crops :: Fruits:: Mango   \n  \n |   \n |  **Anthracnose:**_Colletotrichum gloeosporioides_  |  \n| --- |  \n|   \n |  **Symptoms**\n  * Produces leaf spots, blossom blight, wither tip, twigs blight and fruit rot.\n  * Small blister like spots develop on the leaves and twigs. Young leaves wither and dry Tender twigs wither and die back symptom appears.\n  * Affected branches ultimately dry up. Black spots appear on fruits.\n  * The fruit pulp becomes hard, crack and decay at ripening. Infected fruits drop\n\n  \n | ![Mango Symptom](https://agritech.tnau.ac.in/crop_protection/images/mango/mangoanthracnose/crop_prot_crop%20diseases_fruits_mango_clip_image006.gif)  | ![](https://agritech.tnau.ac.in/crop_protection/images/mango/mangoanthracnose/mango_anthracnose.jpg)  | **![](https://agritech.tnau.ac.in/crop_protection/images/mango/mangoanthracnose/crop_prot_crop%20diseases_fruits_mango_clip_image004_0001.jpg)** | ![](https://agritech.tnau.ac.in/crop_protection/images/mango/mangoanthracnose/mango_anthracnose_on_leaves.png)  | ![](https://agritech.tnau.ac.in/crop_protection/images/mango/mangoanthracnose/crop_prot_crop%20diseases_fruits_mango_clip_image002_0001.jpg)  |  \n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |  \n| **Symptoms on fruits**  | **Mango Anthracnose on Leaves**  |  \n| ![](https://agritech.tnau.ac.in/crop_protection/images/mango/mangoanthracnose/ollectotrichum_gleosporoides.jpg)  | ![](https://agritech.tnau.ac.in/crop_protection/images/mango/mangoanthracnose/mango_anthracnose_on_fruits1.wmf.jpg)  |  \n| --- | --- |  \n| **Colletotrichum _gloeosporioides_**  | **Mango Anthracnose on Fruits**  |  \n**Management**\n  * Spray  _P. fluorescens_ (FP 7) at 3 weeks interval commencing from October at 5g/like on flower branches.\n  * 5-7 sprays one to be given on flowers and bunches.\n  * Before storage, treat with hot water, (50-55°C) for 15 minutes or dip in Benomyl solution (500ppm) or Thiobendazole (1000ppm) for 5 minutes\n\n |  \n |  \n |  \n |  \n |  \n| \n* * *\n[Home](https://agritech.tnau.ac.in/index.html \"Home\") | [About Us](https://agritech.tnau.ac.in/about_us/abt_us.html \"About Us\") | [Success Stories](https://agritech.tnau.ac.in/success_stories/success_index.html \"Success Stories\") | [Farmers Association](https://agritech.tnau.ac.in/farm_association/farm_assoct.html \"Farmers Association\") | [Farmers' Innovation](https://agritech.tnau.ac.in/farm_innovations/farm_innovations.html) | [Publications](https://agritech.tnau.ac.in/tnau_publish.html \"TNAU Publications\") | [Contact Us ](https://agritech.tnau.ac.in/contact.html \"Contact Us\") © 2015 TNAU. All Rights Reserved.  |\n", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\"><html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><head>\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"Agriculture, TNAU, Precision Farming, Organic Farming,Daily News Paper Farm Information, Daily Market Information, TNAU Weather,Horticulture, Organic Agriculture, Agriculture Engineering, Agriculture Marketing, Seed Certification, Crop Protection, Crop Insurance,Fishery, Forestry, Animal Husbandry, Sericulture, Commmunity Radio,KVK, E Extension Center,Govt Schemes &amp; Services,Variety Releases\">\n<title>TNAU Agritech Portal :: Crop Protection</title>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\">\n<!--\nfunction MM_openBrWindow(theURL,winName,features) { //v2.0\n  window.open(theURL,winName,features);\n}\n//-->\n</script>\n<style type=\"text/css\">\n<!--\nbody {\nmargin:0px auto;\n}\n.bord\n{\n\tborder-right:1px solid \n}\n.tit\n{\n\tcolor:#666666;\n\tfont-size:16px;\n\n\tline-height:1.4;\n\tfont-family:Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n}\n#apDiv1 {\n\tposition:absolute;\n\tleft:-1px;\n\ttop:-2px;\n\twidth:936px;\n\theight:110px;\n\tz-index:1;\n}\n.small\n{\n\tfont-size:9px;\n\tcolor:#919191;\n\tpadding-left: 2px;\n}\n#apDiv2 {\n\tposition:absolute;\n\tleft:0px;\n\ttop:107px;\n\twidth:970px;\n\theight:25px;\n\tz-index:2;\n\tbackground-color: #F2F2F2;\n}\n#apDiv2 {\n\tfont-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n\tfont-size: 12px;\n\tfont-style: normal;\n\tvertical-align: middle;\n}\n#apDiv2 {\n\tvertical-align: 50%;\n}\n.style1 {\n\tfont-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n\tfont-size: smaller;\n\ttext-align: center;\n}\n.style3 {color: #398CB5}\n.style9 {\n\tcolor: #555555;\n\tfont-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n\tfont-size: 12px;\n}\n.style121 {border-radius: 10px;\n}\na:link {\n\tcolor: #000000;\n\ttext-decoration: none;\n}\na:visited {\n\ttext-decoration: none;\n\tcolor: #000000;\n}\na:hover {\n\ttext-decoration: underline;\n\tcolor: #398CB5;\n}\na:active {\n\ttext-decoration: none;\n\tcolor: #000000;\n}\n.Links {font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; }\n.style12 {\n\tfont-size: 16px;\n\tfont-weight: bold;\n}\n.style33 {font-size: 16px}\n.cont {\tfont-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n\tfont-size:12px;\n\tpadding-left:2px;\n}\n.head {\tcolor:#009900;\n\tfont-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n\tfont-size:15px;\n\tfont-weight:bold;\n}\n.style123 {border-radius: 10px;\n}\n.style124 {border-radius: 10px;\n}\n.style127 {border-radius: 10px;\n}\n.style129 {border-radius: 10px;\n}\n.style131 {border-radius: 10px;\n}\n.style133 {border-radius: 10px;\n}\n.style1211 {border-radius: 10px;\n}\n.style1231 {border-radius: 10px;\n}\n.style1241 {border-radius: 10px;\n}\n\n-->\n</style></head>\n\n<body>\n<div align=\"center\">\n  <table width=\"970\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n    <!--DWLayoutTable-->\n    \n    <tbody><tr>\n      <td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#f2f2f2\"><img src=\"images/index/cp_index.jpg\" alt=\"TNAU Agritech Portal\" title=\"TNAU Agritech Portal\" width=\"970\" height=\"114\" border=\"0\" usemap=\"#Map16\"></td>\n    </tr> <tr>\n      <td width=\"708\" align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\" bgcolor=\"#BADA8C\" class=\"style1\"><a href=\"../index.html\" title=\"Home\">Home</a> | <a href=\"../about_us/abt_us.html\" title=\"About Us\">About Us</a> | <a href=\"../success_stories/success_index.html\" title=\"Success Stories\">Success Stories</a> | <a href=\"../farm_association/farm_assoct.html\" title=\"Farmer's Association\">Farmers Association</a> | <a href=\"../farm_innovations/farm_innovations.html\">Farmers' Innovation</a> | <a href=\"../tnau_publish.html\" title=\"TNAU Publications\">Publications</a> | <a href=\"../contact.html\" title=\"Contact Us\">Contact</a></td>\n      <td width=\"253\" align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#BADA8C\" style=\"height:22; vertical-align:middle;\">  \n  \n<form action=\"http://www.google.com/cse\" name=\"cse-search-box\" id=\"cse-search-box\">\n                    <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"cx\" value=\"006946231307976124146:qlhbhb-aevy\">\n                    <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"ie\" value=\"UTF-8\">\n                    <input type=\"text\" name=\"q\" size=\"23\">\n                    <input type=\"submit\" name=\"sa\" value=\"Search\">\n        </form>    </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" class=\"style1\"><div align=\"left\">\n        <div align=\"left\" class=\"style12\"> <span class=\"style33\"><br>\n          Horticultural crops :: Fruits:: Mango</span></div>\n      </div>\n        <br>\n        <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\n          <tbody><tr>\n            <td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" bordercolor=\"#ffffff\">\n                \n                <tbody><tr>\n                  <td width=\"100%\" align=\"left\" valign=\"middle\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" class=\"head\"><strong> Anthracnose:</strong><em>&nbsp;Colletotrichum&nbsp; gloeosporioides </em></td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"><table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n                      <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                          <td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"><strong class=\"head\">Symptoms</strong>\n                            <ul type=\"disc\">\n                              <li>\n                                <div align=\"justify\">Produces leaf spots, blossom blight, wither tip, twigs blight and fruit rot.</div>\n                              </li>\n                              <li>\n                                <div align=\"justify\">Small blister like spots develop on the leaves and twigs. Young leaves&nbsp; wither&nbsp; and dry&nbsp; Tender twigs wither and die back&nbsp; symptom appears.</div>\n                              </li>\n                              <li>\n                                <div align=\"justify\">Affected branches ultimately dry up. Black spots appear on fruits.</div>\n                              </li>\n                              <li>\n                                <div align=\"justify\">The fruit pulp becomes hard, crack and decay at ripening. Infected fruits drop</div>\n                              </li>\n                            </ul>\n                            <table width=\"200\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n                              <tbody>\n                                <tr>\n                                  <td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"><img src=\"images/mango/mangoanthracnose/crop_prot_crop diseases_fruits_mango_clip_image006.gif\" alt=\"Mango Symptom\" width=\"197\" height=\"165\" hspace=\"12\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" class=\"style1211\"></td>\n                                  <td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"><img src=\"images/mango/mangoanthracnose/mango_anthracnose.jpg\" width=\"145\" height=\"172\" class=\"style1241\"></td>\n                                  <td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"><strong><img src=\"images/mango/mangoanthracnose/crop_prot_crop diseases_fruits_mango_clip_image004_0001.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"197\" height=\"156\" hspace=\"12\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" class=\"style1231\"></strong></td>\n                                  <td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"><img src=\"images/mango/mangoanthracnose/mango_anthracnose_on_leaves.png\" width=\"258\" height=\"276\" border=\"0\" class=\"style1241\"></td>\n                                  <td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"><img src=\"images/mango/mangoanthracnose/crop_prot_crop diseases_fruits_mango_clip_image002_0001.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"197\" height=\"156\" hspace=\"12\" border=\"0\" align=\"middle\" class=\"style1241\"></td>\n                                </tr>\n                                <tr>\n                                  <td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"><strong>Symptoms on fruits</strong></td>\n                                  <td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"><strong>Mango Anthracnose on Leaves</strong></td>\n                                </tr>\n                              </tbody>\n                            </table>\n                            <table width=\"66%\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">\n                              <tbody><tr>\n                                <td width=\"45%\" align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\"><img src=\"images/mango/mangoanthracnose/ollectotrichum_gleosporoides.jpg\" width=\"415\" height=\"440\" border=\"0\" class=\"style1241\"></td>\n                                <td width=\"55%\" align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\"><img src=\"images/mango/mangoanthracnose/mango_anthracnose_on_fruits1.wmf.jpg\" width=\"715\" height=\"605\" border=\"0\" class=\"style1241\"></td>\n                              </tr>\n                              <tr>\n                                <td align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\"><strong>Colletotrichum&nbsp; <em>gloeosporioides </em></strong></td>\n                                <td align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\"><strong>Mango Anthracnose on Fruits</strong></td>\n                              </tr>\n                            </tbody></table>\n                            <p class=\"head\"><strong>Management</strong></p>\n                            <ul>\n                              <li>\n                                <div align=\"justify\">Spray&nbsp;<em>P. fluorescens</em>&nbsp;(FP 7) at 3 weeks interval commencing from October at 5g/like on flower branches.</div>\n                              </li>\n                              <li>\n                                <div align=\"justify\">5-7 sprays one to be given on flowers and bunches.</div>\n                              </li>\n                              <li>\n                                <div align=\"justify\">Before storage, treat with hot water, (50-55°C) for 15 minutes or dip in Benomyl solution (500ppm) or Thiobendazole (1000ppm) for 5 minutes</div>\n                              </li>\n                          </ul></td>\n                        </tr>\n                      </tbody>\n                  </table></td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr></tr>\n              \n            </tbody></table></td>\n          </tr>\n      </tbody></table>           </td>\n    </tr>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n    <tr>\n      <td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" align=\"center\"><hr>\n        <span class=\"style9\"><a href=\"../index.html\" title=\"Home\">Home</a> | <a href=\"../about_us/abt_us.html\" title=\"About Us\">About Us</a> | <a href=\"../success_stories/success_index.html\" title=\"Success Stories\">Success Stories</a> | <a href=\"../farm_association/farm_assoct.html\" title=\"Farmers Association\">Farmers Association</a> | <a href=\"../farm_innovations/farm_innovations.html\">Farmers' Innovation</a> | <a href=\"../tnau_publish.html\" title=\"TNAU Publications\">Publications</a> | <a href=\"../contact.html\" title=\"Contact Us\">Contact Us </a></span>\n        <p></p>\n      <p class=\"style9\">© 2015 TNAU. All Rights Reserved.</p></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody></table>\n</div>\n\n<map name=\"Map16\" id=\"Map16\"><area shape=\"rect\" coords=\"631,82,687,102\" href=\"#\" title=\"Agritech Portal - English\">\n<area shape=\"rect\" coords=\"698,82,733,101\" href=\"../ta/crop_protection/mango_ta_1.html\" title=\"Agritech Portal - Tamil\">\n</map>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\">\nvar gaJsHost = ((\"https:\" == document.location.protocol) ? \"https://ssl.\" : \"http://www.\");\ndocument.write(unescape(\"%3Cscript src='\" + gaJsHost + \"google-analytics.com/ga.js' type='text/javascript'%3E%3C/script%3E\"));\n</script><script src=\"https://ssl.google-analytics.com/ga.js\" type=\"text/javascript\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\">\ntry {\nvar pageTracker = _gat._getTracker(\"UA-13067640-1\");\npageTracker._trackPageview();\n} catch(err) {}</script>\n\n\n\n</body></html>", "extracted_images": [{"crop": "mango", "disease": "disease_symptom", "image_url": "https://agritech.tnau.ac.